<title>USA: Coke says U.S. case volume hit 11-year high.</title>
<headline>Coke says U.S. case volume hit 11-year high.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Co said on Monday that the nine percent growth rate it recorded in domestic unit case sales during the first-quarter marked an 11-year high for quarterly sales in the United States.</p>
<p>A Coke spokesman said the pace of expansion was the best the company had seen domestically since U.S. unit case sales grew 9.9 percent in the first quarter of 1986.</p>
</text>
